   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1998-08-06",
   "text": "Financial Markets Reassurance Act of 1998 - Prohibits, with specified exceptions, the Commodity Futures Trading Commission from proposing or issuing any rule or regulation that restricts or regulates activity in a qualifying hybrid instrument or swap agreement during a specified time period."
